WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:10.809
The Aztecs sacrificed 1% of their population
every year, or about 250,000 people.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:24.100
They also sacrificed eagles, jaguars, butterflies
and hummingbirds.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:31.720
William Herschel, discoverer of Uranus, lived
to be 84 – the same number of years that

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:35.520
Uranus takes to orbit the Sun.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:42.190
Seahorses are the only fish with a neck and
the only family of animals where the male

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:44.180
gives birth.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:51.120
The word Sciapodous means one has feet large
enough to be used as umbrellas.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:57.620
Powerful acids in snakes' stomachs mean they
will explode if given Alka-Seltzer.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:06.190
Over the years, the British Royal Navy's fleet
has included HMS Seagull, HMS Keith, HMS Tortoise,

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.799
HMS Wensleydale and HMS Cockchafer.

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:15.780
Nigeria makes more movies every year than
the US.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:20.020
Venezuela is Spanish for 'Little Venice'.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:27.000
Despite their names, white rhinos and black
rhinos are the same colour.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.260
Feeding canaries red peppers turns them orange.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:39.740
Hummingbirds have 2,000 meals a day and hibernate
every night.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:47.549
In 2007, a Bosnian called Amir Vehabovic faked
his own death to see how many people would

00:01:47.549 --> 00:01:49.530
go to his funeral.

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:52.500
Only his mother turned up.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:58.860
Queen Elizabeth I often drank two pints of
strong beer for breakfast.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:07.659
In 1875, the king of Fiji brought back measles
from a state visit to Australia and wiped

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:11.090
out a quarter of his own people.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:18.340
In 2003, six monkeys were funded by the Arts
Council of England to see how long it would

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:21.640
take them to type the works of Shakespeare.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:28.400
After six months, they had failed to produce
a single word of English, broken the computer

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:34.590
and used the keyboard as a lavatory.

